aid since I had never been to Hard Rock before we had to go. The place was nice, the food was... Ok... My salmon was extremely dry but my broccoli was cooked to perfection. What made our entire night was our server Nicole. She made everything so enjoyable. When I could not decide on a signature drink, she offered me the \"purple haze\" , I had it and it was just what I never knew I wanted. I will go back just to be able to sit at her table again."},{"business_id":"w4K9raWb6XdiEcBcUVoA7A","review_id":"h2iAlKF7mujc12Y4iXqs0g","date":"2010-10-20T03:50:09","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9420191049575806,"text_excerpt":"I love this place...and so does everyone I have taken there. The hosts are always friendly and quick to seat you. The wait staff is observant and ready to please. The food has never been a disappointment. The music is a little louder than I want it to be while I'm dining out with others, but It's the Hard Rock Cafe! You should expect the music turned up, lots of things to look at and a great experience."}],"visual":[]},"notebook_case":null}
